# ZeroPoint inference spend log — JSONL, one call per line.
# Lines starting with # are ignored by the dashboard.
#
# Expected per-call fields:
#   ts              ISO 8601 timestamp
#   provider        "anthropic" | "abacus" | "openai" | "local" | ...
#   model           model identifier (e.g. "claude-sonnet-4-5", "glm-5.2")
#   input_tokens    integer
#   output_tokens   integer
#   total_cost_usd  float (optional; dashboard computes from PRICES map if absent)
#   context         string, optional short label describing the task
#
# Wrappers append one JSON line per completed inference call.
# No entries yet — dashboard shows empty state until first call lands.
